The second part of A4. When an outgoing ask's body is over 400 characters
after the writer and the editor, the question goes once more to the editor
model with the brief Misho approved tonight, word for word (§106):
„Rewrite this question shorter, under 400 characters, in the same language.
Keep every fact, name and number exactly as written; add nothing and drop no
fact." The rewrite is used only when it is shorter, keeps every number of
the original and asks one question; otherwise the ask goes as written and
the [ask-length] line is logged. Never blocked.

Also records §107 (1695's prepared-answer brief, Misho's yes) in
ADMIN_WRITE_OPERATIONS.md; its code is a separate commit.

DONE WHEN: an ask the writer first made 600 characters comes out under 400
on the second pass with every fact kept; a log line shows one that could
not be shortened.

